{"title":"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we express the sum\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf021ead1590554d4996161c2d950d3c7f447e08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 1{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11} + \\frac 1{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 13} + \\frac 1{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} + \\frac 1{3\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} + \\frac 1{5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"558\" height=\"37\" /> </center>\n<p>as a rational number in reduced form, then the denominator will be\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3fe4240270899d2fdd51fbf04d42974d3c2c43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }15015 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }5005 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ }455 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }385 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ }91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"450\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By changing the fractions to have a common <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Denominator\" title=\"Denominator\">denominator</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/a/97a786d266859d42955ae679d1d175ea91197ee1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"115\" height=\"13\" />, it is easier to add them and simplify the sum. \n</p><p>Doing so yields:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf021ead1590554d4996161c2d950d3c7f447e08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 1{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11} + \\frac 1{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 13} + \\frac 1{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} + \\frac 1{3\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} + \\frac 1{5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"558\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e3d69933d021ff0a74d618ff6eb94d7679d885.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {13}{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} + \\frac {11}{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} + \\frac {7}{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} + \\frac {5}{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} + \\frac {3}{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"688\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/2/d32c85f088cb814790a866bc295785e4310c6366.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {39}{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} = \\frac {3\\cdot13}{3\\cdot 5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11\\cdot 13} = \\frac{1}{5\\cdot 7\\cdot 11} = \\frac{1}{385}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"409\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b0e4c0740b8133ade31c09f8acfa3275b0ba7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$385 \\Rightarrow D$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_14\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 14\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_16\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 16\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018104154\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 36/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2424/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3445:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018104154 and revision id 8919. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}